{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_140_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_140_ng_01_title", "source_sha256": "b0f51b2e7903ef4831844e253ffc6f552c037a1a90ec8d56a6f05478d2094c08", "ja": "波乱必至の二人三脚", "zh": "注定波澜起伏的两人三足", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_140_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_140_ng_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "053e05807ba4f1dcf7888cb48d69da0c70786061cde84abdc12e8213731086de", "ja": "BOT連動ドラマ『ヘキサ・アカデミクス』\nの撮影もいよいよ佳境へ！\n体を張ったアクションシーンの撮影に\n全力で挑む、アイドル達の一幕です。", "zh": "BOT联动剧《Hexa Academics》\n的拍摄终于也渐入佳境！\n这是一幕偶像们全力挑战\n亲自上阵的动作戏拍摄的场景。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_140_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_140_ng_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "776eab3f9e4ba707914428eb15e476f6a8cc44c8aab8959078668cb88fdb5f8d", "ja": "（今日は『BATTLE OF THEATER』連動の\nドラマ『ヘキサ・アカデミクス』の撮影がある）", "zh": "（今天要拍摄《BATTLE OF THEATER》联动电视剧《六边形学园》。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_140_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_140_ng_01_1001_p", "source_sha256": "93eccf9ef965adf5a966299a91e8ceb73c6161cbcb033d165c72dc09e1ee3f8a", "ja": "（やっぱり、かなりアクションが多いみたいだな……\nみんながケガしないように、しっかり見守らないと！）", "zh": "（果然，好像有很多动作戏……为了不让大家受伤，我得好好看着才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_140_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_140_ng_01_1002_null", "source_sha256": "f3429af89e27de750bb10365669fbf893b1ae49fa9e869c54883abdadb34370d", "ja": "ザッ、ザッ、ザッ、ザッ……", "zh": "沙、沙、沙、沙……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_140_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_140_ng_01_1003_006mak", "source_sha256": "1fc6d68fd0ec41f29172c836fd5ec838a19ca9eea86c3b51977b25f928b9566f", "ja": "へえ～、ここが今年の合同体育祭の会場か……\nくぅーっ、燃えてきた！　瑞希、今日こそ勝負だ！", "zh": "哦～，这里就是今年联合体育祭的会场啊……\n呜——，我热血沸腾起来了！瑞希，今天一定要和你一决胜负！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_140_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_140_ng_01_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "621a86af6cc7ef6060c423736024c2cb73ac4aa10501e7d6b0624679fc524bd3", "ja": "菊地さん。その熱意は買いますが……\n我々は任務で来ているということを、お忘れなく。", "zh": "菊地先生。这份热情我很欣赏，但是……请不要忘记，我们是来执行任务的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_140_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_140_ng_01_1005_044miz", "source_sha256": "9195a67120bd688b4da24defde11900867601d874a8ece04cb630ae88a5fbfa6", "ja": "任務の内容は、『司書』の護衛……\nこちらが、現場担当の島原さんです。どうも。", "zh": "任务内容是护卫“图书管理员”……\n这位是负责现场工作的岛原小姐。你好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_140_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_140_ng_01_1006_018ele", "source_sha256": "8f9aa502a4b8057336fe9dadd52faec283246dd91c64483eb356eb92c4c038c6", "ja": "……。つーん。", "zh": "……哼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_140_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_140_ng_01_1007_006mak", "source_sha256": "ebf85afd98d01d6eb95ffd79bf442fbec18fdd8c83cde297ddb8178e10269c6b", "ja": "あれ？　もしかして……ワサビの食べすぎ？", "zh": "哎？　难道是……芥末吃多了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_140_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_140_ng_01_1008_018ele", "source_sha256": "08c634cb51e54af7f81e45d1e2e013a03131ec62425ed003291421016c5bece5", "ja": "違うヨッ！　アナタたち『セクター・ゼロ』には\n協力しないヨ、っていう態度を見せてるノ！", "zh": "才不是啦！我是在摆明态度，说我们不会协助你们“零号扇区”哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_140_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_140_ng_01_1009_018ele", "source_sha256": "ed3c43371795b0cab30736d2b39d18c6e2c7120b5415ffbf5937c0bc0dbd23d8", "ja": "所轄には所轄の意地があるんだから！\nアナタたちの出番はないかもネ？　バイバイ！", "zh": "辖区有辖区的骨气嘛！  \n你们可能没机会上场了吧？拜拜！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_140_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_140_ng_01_1010_044miz", "source_sha256": "01227d158274f2907e77cd9d288fa660ccf9377605a56cdb1be2f492b3b4a139", "ja": "おや、嫌われてしまいましたね。まあ、\n我々は我々の仕事をするだけですが。……しゅん。", "zh": "哎呀，被讨厌了呢。算了，我们只要做好自己的工作就行了。……垂头丧气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_140_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_140_ng_01_1011_announce", "source_sha256": "d5e2a15e5bd54271014095bc6e8c8b7da5818ab668ec7426d748fe82899a22fb", "ja": "それでは、クロスチーム戦、二人三脚！\n位置について、よーい……", "zh": "那么，跨队对战，两人三脚！\n各就各位，预备……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_140_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_140_ng_01_1012_se", "source_sha256": "050a9a3b13c8a5a3471867dc9bc6e2e487c5b2531f4251d42c143541a5d7e52b", "ja": "パンッ！", "zh": "啪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_140_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_140_ng_01_1013_001har", "source_sha256": "1fb2ce3c5d418698f3536c04ad5328caf184537df1b517d062d8d4c74930eec1", "ja": "よーし！　いくよ、志保ちゃん！", "zh": "好——！要上咯，志保！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_140_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_140_ng_01_1014_033sih", "source_sha256": "26502eb2d5bb80518ba1e1e41afa7c5ea9e08638b825b6df1e0bb8f427f10e7d", "ja": "は、はい！\nえっと、春香さんにテンポを合わせて……。", "zh": "好、好的！\n那个，要配合春香的节奏……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_140_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_140_ng_01_1015_001har", "source_sha256": "9645636c34a7c1b7fbf03a6b4a24701a84759a0c4469ae113314fb1806f84c8d", "ja": "え、あっ！　っと、わわっ！？", "zh": "诶，啊！等等，哇哇！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_140_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_140_ng_01_1016_se", "source_sha256": "8e1ecc900deefe2cbf5ea2f88e520d751789223581bc3ea9c0c881834acdae5f", "ja": "どんがらがっしゃーんっ！！", "zh": "咚哐啷哐啷——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_140_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_140_ng_01_1017_001har", "source_sha256": "52ea20da18d6db5e06f86bdd8d06339613d7f82549f779391a6ccfc1236fc665", "ja": "うぅ、痛かったぁ……ごめんね、志保ちゃん！\n巻き込んじゃったけど、大丈夫だった？", "zh": "呜呜，好痛啊……对不起哦，志保！\n把你卷进来了，你没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_140_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_140_ng_01_1018_033sih", "source_sha256": "57c385674654e0ab0b52d880be8c1565f300ccf8c2d36f2a0f47b8607cfc65a4", "ja": "大丈夫です。私のほうこそ、すみません。\n私が遅いせいで、足を引っ張ってしまって。", "zh": "我没事。我才应该说对不起。\n都怪我跑得慢，拖了后腿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_140_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_140_ng_01_1019_001har", "source_sha256": "3feb5b13ec56e5cde299d5742a6fc17b9ed2fadf668b692170729b353ea72bb5", "ja": "そんなことないよ！　大丈夫、まだ追いつけるよ。\n最後まで諦めないで、走ろう！", "zh": "才不是那样！没关系，还能追上的。\n在最后之前都不要放弃，一起跑吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_140_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_140_ng_01_1020_006mak", "source_sha256": "337da1cb1032f6aa8ecac7552b96261934cf5a8a50c7b6219f83571273b1c5e6", "ja": "あれが、ターゲットの志保か……そうでなくても\n守ってあげたくなるような、可愛い子だね。", "zh": "那就是目标志保吗……就算不是目标，也是个让人忍不住想保护的可爱孩子呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_140_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_140_ng_01_1021_044miz", "source_sha256": "959ed44495b6c74d0678599dd78d10d06579fb590e8fbe6f3ee5cd0fed17db32", "ja": "北沢さんは、深青で一番若い『司書』です。今日の\n体育祭、とても楽しみにしていました……どや。", "zh": "北泽小姐是深青最年轻的“司书”。她一直很期待今天的体育祭……哼哼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_140_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_140_ng_01_1022_006mak", "source_sha256": "e988f453749358a0e3223700ce0ad7c5a6ce29613609d30d11812431f8a2a2cb", "ja": "で、一緒にいるのは、ええと……カゲロウの天海春香。\nまだ陰界で目覚めてない一般人、と……。", "zh": "然后，和我在一起的是，呃……阳炎的天海春香。还没在阴界觉醒的普通人……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_140_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_140_ng_01_1023_tekiseiryokurida", "source_sha256": "11eb9a89abb471d2fee7ab152bbae3b6cd5f1782e0ea77ca9b9243bf1111a00e", "ja": "……。\nよしっ、今だ！　行けーっ！", "zh": "……。\n好，就是现在！冲啊——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_140_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_140_ng_01_1024_tekiseiryoku", "source_sha256": "b51850e76b75175af2e037cf3bf09546403a00373398fed2c683ee6e6b60b460", "ja": "ワーッ！！！！", "zh": "哇——！！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_140_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_140_ng_01_1025_006mak", "source_sha256": "9cc89924e81ab8cc3781523daa87f1375065553e1ebce960619d9e9147ff7911", "ja": "ああっ！？　あいつら、応援団に紛れて……\nしまった、出遅れた！", "zh": "啊啊！？那些家伙混进啦啦队里了……\n糟糕，落后一步了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_140_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_140_ng_01_1026_se", "source_sha256": "28402667b8eb191ed18f6a5194ad223ab6e222230bdba8db586e2629f3361e79", "ja": "チュドーン！　ドカーンッ！", "zh": "轰——！　砰——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_140_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_140_ng_01_1027_018ele", "source_sha256": "5c09c22d64551d53a7f69b8cc28389c4243693f0c1a5c65c2750276405c07976", "ja": "近寄らせないヨ？　ホラホラ、ワタシの\n『フレンドボール』、地面に落としたら爆発するヨ！", "zh": "不让你们靠近哦？看吧看吧，我的“友情球”，要是掉到地上就会爆炸哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_140_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_140_ng_01_1028_tekiseiryoku", "source_sha256": "0b784cbf81f67557a8794a8138da9cfd85c6d27186f5e969b3d1405f8a718e3d", "ja": "機動風紀委員か！？　くそっ！\n陽界で堂々と戦具を……う、うわあぁーっ！？", "zh": "是机动风纪委员吗！？可恶！\n竟敢在阳界公然使用战具……呜、呜哇啊啊——！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_140_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_140_ng_01_1029_se", "source_sha256": "234f65f06ce0e95698c05db27736d5dc3b1c8ba24be56eb40aff995cd0b648d0", "ja": "チュドドドーン！", "zh": "轰隆隆——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_140_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_140_ng_01_1030_tekiseiryoku", "source_sha256": "5f6f7baa9b8f30e5f09d11e12fac58a5736684caa152411b4dfd94fd99158b77", "ja": "っ……よし、抜けた！　このままターゲットを……！", "zh": "呃……好，突围了！就这样对目标……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_140_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_140_ng_01_1031_001har", "source_sha256": "0856083283b9e0dcf46711afed64d6d0fccc7f9dc5d2dfdb44211a484f0dd902", "ja": "さ、さっきから爆発が……って、何か来てる！\n志保ちゃん、逃げなくちゃ！", "zh": "爆、爆炸从刚才开始就……等等，有什么东西过来了！\n志保，我们得赶紧逃！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_140_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_140_ng_01_1032_033sih", "source_sha256": "2529e7a4924613892072d1bc023465ab49859f62bd463951b59d15f0c12db39d", "ja": "に、逃げるって言っても……。\nどうしよう、私の戦具じゃ、こんな数とても……！", "zh": "可、可就算说要逃……  \n怎么办，我的战具根本对付不了这么多……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_140_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_140_ng_01_1033_se", "source_sha256": "a8f88fc8af6c752e53ef835e0370bc0e9c72da24f9b736935d382fe99ce15548", "ja": "もふっ！　もふもふもふっ！", "zh": "毛茸茸！　毛茸茸毛茸茸！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_140_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_140_ng_01_1034_tekiseiryoku", "source_sha256": "53a9ddb4e079c211fbc672589d8d9de01a8a565121aafbadef1e5fc9c23b27db", "ja": "うわっ！？　なんだこのぬいぐるみの群れは……！\n邪魔だ、どけ！", "zh": "哇啊！？这群毛绒玩偶是怎么回事……！\n碍事，让开！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_140_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_140_ng_01_1035_se", "source_sha256": "38b5848a66ab5b6df03e88de5b7749ebbcf524d55be5ec12d741ebd39a97b3ac", "ja": "ドカッ！　もふっ！　バキッ！", "zh": "咚！蓬！咔嚓！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_140_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_140_ng_01_1036_tekiseiryoku", "source_sha256": "d6c5a9457fcf5fcdb284e83669bc2cdff124a9cf359e05a0fc5f8bc29411fafb", "ja": "ぐわあっ！？　あ、ああっ……？　がはっ！\nき、気をつけろ、こいつらメチャクチャ強いぞ！", "zh": "呜哇！？　啊、啊啊……？　咳啊！\n小、小心，这些家伙强得离谱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "special_140_ng_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_140_ng_01_1037_006mak", "source_sha256": "5236783ec9b77956b21159e6b919f004d6031a485764f009304b6fe535e2152f", "ja": "ふう……瑞希、あっちはなんとかなりそうだよ。\nボクのぬいぐるみたちが間に合った。", "zh": "呼……瑞希，那边应该能应付得来。\n我的玩偶们及时赶到了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
